{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">CONNECTED function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309110","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CONNECTED-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CONNECTED-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"CONNECTED-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">CONNECTED function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CONNECTED-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Tells whether a database is connected. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">logical\nname</var> is the logical name or <var class=\"keyword varname\">alias</var> is\nthe alias of a connected database, the CONNECTED function returns\nTRUE; otherwise, it returns FALSE.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CONNECTED-function__syntax_GC158V2683017\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d424019e102\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CONNECTED-function__idGDG21K2664325\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>CONNECTED ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">logical-name</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> <var class=\"keyword varname\">alias</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">logical-name </var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">Refers to a logical name. It can be a quoted string or a character expression.\nAn unquoted character string is not allowed.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">alias</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">Refers to an alias. It can be a quoted string or a character\nexpression. An unquoted character string is not allowed.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CONNECTED-function__example_GC158W2683026\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d424019e164\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure runs <span class=\"ph filepath\">r-dispcu.p</span> if a database with\nthe logical name <code class=\"ph codeph\">sports2000</code> is connected:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-cnctd.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CONNECTED-function__idGDG21L2664333\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>IF CONNECTED(&quot;sports2000&quot;) THEN RUN r-dispcu.p.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CONNECTED-function__see-also_GC158X2683033\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d424019e205\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ALIAS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ALIAS-function.html\">ALIAS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CONNECT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CONNECT-statement.html\">CONNECT statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-ALIAS-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-ALIAS-statement.html\">CREATE ALIAS statement</a>,<a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-CALL-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-CALL-statement.html\">CREATE CALL statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATASERVERS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATASERVERS-function.html\">DATASERVERS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DBCODEPAGE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DBCODEPAGE-function.html\">DBCODEPAGE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DBCOLLATION-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DBCOLLATION-function.html\">DBCOLLATION function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DBRESTRICTIONS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DBRESTRICTIONS-function.html\">DBRESTRICTIONS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DBTYPE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DBTYPE-function.html\">DBTYPE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DBVERSION-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DBVERSION-function.html\">DBVERSION function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DELETE-ALIAS-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DELETE-ALIAS-statement.html\">DELETE ALIAS statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DISCONNECT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DISCONNECT-statement.html\">DISCONNECT statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-DB-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-DB-function.html\">FRAME-DB function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LDBNAME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LDBNAME-function.html\">LDBNAME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"NUM-DBS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/NUM-DBS-function.html\">NUM-DBS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PDBNAME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PDBNAME-function.html\">PDBNAME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SDBNAME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SDBNAME-function.html\">SDBNAME function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CONNECT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CONNECT-statement.html\">CONNECT statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CONSTRUCTOR-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CONSTRUCTOR-statement.html\">CONSTRUCTOR statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309110","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"CONNECTED function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CONNECTED-function.html","type":"Manual"}